Tool response:
Tool: search_investors
Description: Find investors by their full name or email address. Returns matching investor records with IDs for further queries.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "Partial or full name of the investor",
          "title": "Name"
        },
        "email": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "Email address of the investor",
          "title": "Email"
        }
      },
      "required": []
    }

Tool response:
Tool: find_investor_holdings
Description: Retrieve all active securities held by a given investor, including company details, security type, 
quantity/principal amount, status, latest valuation date, and estimated holding value where available.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "investor_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Investor Id",
          "description": ""
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "investor_id"
      ]
    }
